  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">A compact sporty style inspired by archival Coach designs, the Locke crossbody bag is crafted of lightweight Signature nylon detailed with our Coach patch. This slim style has space for the largest size phone, an inside organizational pocket and an outside zip pocket for easy access to essentials. The shell and webbing of this bag is crafted of 100% recycled polyamide (better known as nylon). It also has 100% recycled polyester lining. It’s all part of our commitment to rethinking and reducing our impact on the planet by repurposing waste materials.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Signature nylon jacquard, natural grain leather and vegetable-tanned leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Recycled polyester lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside open pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">5.0&quot; (L) x 7.0&quot; (H) x 2.75&quot; (W)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Adjustable strap with 21.5&quot; drop for shoulder or crossbody wear</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
